WEBVTT

00:14.360 --> 00:17.200
Imperial Father... your son has conceded defeat.

00:19.960 --> 00:24.000
The chessboard is like a battlefield—never succumb to hesitation.

00:24.440 --> 00:29.700
Remember: either do not contest at all, or fight to the very end!

00:31.960 --> 00:36.200
Wen Xian, you've watched for quite a while. Give us your verdict.

00:37.280 --> 00:42.600
His Highness the Prince of Jin is remarkably sharp—within the imperial palace, only Your Majesty can best him!

00:43.120 --> 00:49.600
Quite unlike the Prince of Ning, a hopeless novice who rushes to the palace to wager whenever he acquires something novel!
